            <content:encoded>
                &lt;p&gt;Nature Human Behaviour, Published online: 24 November 2026; &lt;a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s41562-026-02615-0"&gt;doi:10.1038/s41562-026-02615-0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;This Review evaluates evidence for eight pressing concerns about how AI is affecting people. It finds modest support for the most alarming claims but calls for deeper scrutiny of the human impact of AI.</content:encoded>
